        },
        "text_BXxKtm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Millions of non-stick cookware pieces end up in landfills every year. Once their chemical coatings wear off and peel, they turn right back into sticky pans. Even worse, they become toxic and release microplastics directly into your food and body, disrupting your hormonal balance and long-term health. At Tree, we believe your kitchen and health deserve better. That is why we chose stainless steel that lasts a lifetime. It does not wear out easily, you will not need to replace it every season, and most importantly, it never interferes with your body or hormonal balance.</p>"
          }
